         - OS/Arch: darwin/arm64
         - macOS version: 14.2.1 (23C71)

      - Machine #2 specs:
         - Docker version 20.10.17, build 100c701
         - OS/Arch: linux/arm64
         - macOS version: 14.1.2</output>
